1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,729 --> 00:00:10,534
Last time, we found
groups of two and three.

3
00:00:13,134 --> 00:00:20,493
Today we are going to learn left
and right, and higher and lower.

4
00:00:23,493 --> 00:00:29,644
Hold your hands out in front of
you. Palms down. Knuckles up.

5
00:00:33,344 --> 00:00:35,734
This is your left hand.

6
00:00:38,634 --> 00:00:40,734
Keep your palm down.

7
00:00:40,784 --> 00:00:44,244
Point one finger away, thumb out.

8
00:00:44,294 --> 00:00:45,084
That is an L.

9
00:00:45,134 --> 00:00:47,851
That is your left hand.

10
00:00:51,351 --> 00:00:53,508
This is your right hand.

11
00:00:54,408 --> 00:00:55,608
Left.

12
00:00:56,351 --> 00:00:57,551
Right.

13
00:01:00,294 --> 00:01:02,498
Show me your left hand.

14
00:01:06,598 --> 00:01:08,895
Show me your right hand.

15
00:01:13,495 --> 00:01:16,395
Left and right take lots of practice.

16
00:01:16,445 --> 00:01:18,405
That is okay!

17
00:01:18,455 --> 00:01:21,551
Ask a grown-up to practise with you.

18
00:01:25,051 --> 00:01:28,184
Now let's look at the piano.

19
00:01:28,884 --> 00:01:32,806
A piano has a left
end, and a right end.

20
00:01:36,306 --> 00:01:38,417
Listen to the left end.

21
00:01:40,917 --> 00:01:42,117
Low.

22
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:47,975
Now listen to the right end.

23
00:01:50,475 --> 00:01:51,675
High.

24
00:01:55,157 --> 00:01:58,476
Left is low. Right is high.

25
00:02:04,076 --> 00:02:10,924
Your left hand plays the low sounds.
Your right hand plays the high sounds.

26
00:02:14,724 --> 00:02:19,250
Your turn! Is this sound high, or low?

27
00:02:24,350 --> 00:02:25,550
Low!

28
00:02:28,086 --> 00:02:30,894
Which hand plays this low sound?

29
00:02:35,594 --> 00:02:36,794
Left!

30
00:02:39,330 --> 00:02:43,577
Is this sound on the left
end, or the right end?

31
00:02:48,277 --> 00:02:49,477
Right!

32
00:02:50,013 --> 00:02:51,335
You've got it!

33
00:02:53,035 --> 00:02:54,496
Now it's your turn!

34
00:02:54,596 --> 00:03:00,143
Play Left, Right, High and Low,
and practise with your hands!

35
00:03:00,243 --> 00:03:02,633
See you for the next Nugget!

